Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:07.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.15,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:13.68,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.26,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:24.16,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.41,0:00:26.63,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:28.16,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why the sudden visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:28.54,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:29.92,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:31.38,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:33.64,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's up, Reina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:35.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.16,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going out somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:37.34,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No, we came to visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:38.36,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:38.91,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:41.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan, do you like sweet buns?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.13,0:00:42.16,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:44.01,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're round and sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.01,0:00:45.27,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Then I like them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.27,0:00:48.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, Rin, get some barley tea for Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.41,0:00:50.07,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Let's go, Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:52.45,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We were eating snacks anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:53.91,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I want some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:35.29,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:36.36,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:38.09,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't had these before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.77,0:02:44.96,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:46.48,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.48,0:02:49.06,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time I've come here, but it looks like Grandpa's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:50.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Forget about that. What's up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,bringing along a school bag on a Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:53.95,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.57,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,To be honest, we ran away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:02:59.76,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wha{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:01.70,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Won't the people at home be worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:03.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why would you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:07.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then, it's {\i1}that{\i0}, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:09.53,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean by "that"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.53,0:03:12.21,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You know, a problem with your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:13.38,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,There's that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.57,0:03:15.24,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"Too"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.24,0:03:16.02,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:19.00,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, a problem with his famil{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:20.44,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:26.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Living with your husband's parents must be tough, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.11,0:03:31.52,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if there's anyone who actually gets along with their in-laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:33.85,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:37.55,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have any siblings or any other place to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.95,0:03:38.06,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, we use the same textbook for math!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:39.73,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.73,0:03:41.89,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Show me your other textbooks too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:43.01,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:46.37,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, the Japanese textbook is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.55,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.69,0:03:50.28,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:39.73,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Is it okay if we stay at your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.73,0:03:43.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Before that, you need to talk things through
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:45.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,with your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:48.19,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine. I left a note at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.28,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't say where we'll be,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.66,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,but I did write, "I'll make sure to take Reina to school."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:55.80,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't given much thought to anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:57.33,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't told my parents yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:04:01.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You haven't thought about it? You have a kid with you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.25,0:04:04.07,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,There was no other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.07,0:04:06.75,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I just had to get away from that house,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:07.97,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:13.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:15.93,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go buy groceries for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.93,0:04:17.02,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.73,0:04:20.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have much, but you can use the room on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:20.25,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It really {\i1}is{\i0} different!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.02,0:04:26.34,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. It's a little heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:29.59,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell did you put in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:33.17,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's slippers and textbooks are in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.48,0:04:35.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good job on making it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.35,0:04:42.37,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, you usually eat whatever's available, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:44.48,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cook you a proper meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:45.93,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We don't just eat "whatever."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.27,0:04:48.91,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can we get some sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.57,0:04:51.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,One each, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:52.28,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:54.93,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of meat should we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:57.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:04:59.14,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Not that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:04:59.96,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:02.36,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,This one is a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.44,0:05:09.05,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san! Good afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:11.95,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan! The beef and pork are pretty cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:14.96,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:17.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Um... This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:18.78,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not what it looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:21.96,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is Haruko, a cousin from my mother's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:24.09,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What does it matter if I'm from your mother's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.09,0:05:25.92,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:26.88,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.23,0:05:32.76,Usaghi Main Top,lady,0000,0000,0000,,My son is in the same class as Rin-chan, and I'm indebted to Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.37,0:05:35.86,Usaghi Main Top,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,My daughter is the same age then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.01,0:05:37.84,Usaghi Main Top,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:39.81,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:41.06,Usaghi Main Top,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:32.08,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I explaining myself when she didn't even ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:35.86,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, there's no point in making excuses to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.23,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"It's not what it looks like"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:40.59,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She just started first grade this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.31,0:05:43.71,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:45.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of sweets did you pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:46.64,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Sup, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:47.45,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:49.68,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Deluxe Big Nyan Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:52.19,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Vegetable Castella for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.19,0:05:55.50,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting the Nyan Nyan Kitty Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:59.84,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are those really sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:08.50,Usaghi Main Top,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She was beautiful, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:14.30,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, I guess she's pretty good looking for a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:18.37,Usaghi Main Top,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't try to have an affair with her or anything, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:20.79,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you an idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:22.72,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:25.41,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, she has her hands full\Nliving alone with Kouki,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:26.57,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,so she doesn't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:27.67,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Just them two?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:30.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Moron! You've been watching too many weird dramas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:33.64,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I guess she's like two or three years older than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:35.58,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,H-How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.67,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,So she's divorced, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:42.28,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.33,0:06:46.71,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This looks tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:49.22,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time I've had this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:51.27,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I tried some new things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:54.11,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,When we're at home, I have to prioritize my mother-in-law's preferences.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:57.95,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, I want this at home too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:03.05,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.05,0:07:04.65,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.60,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:08.27,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.27,0:07:10.66,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, hold your chopsticks properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:11.61,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:14.95,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,The floor creaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:16.48,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, take this towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:17.27,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.53,0:07:18.78,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:20.23,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's a bra!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:23.09,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina! Don't pull it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:33.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are they asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:35.60,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.61,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like they both got too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:41.08,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I moved Rin-chan to your futon, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:41.77,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:43.41,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:47.31,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That hits the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:48.89,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Been a while since I've had alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:50.11,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Want something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:52.51,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I gain weight easily these days, so I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:54.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:56.25,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Do I look like I've gained weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.25,0:07:59.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all. I'm just saying, we're finally in our 30's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:03.23,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could go back to just being 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:05.74,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,We're different from when we were young,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:07.46,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,so we need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:11.02,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I say that, my husband doesn't care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:13.11,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know why I'm working so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:19.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.27,0:08:20.08,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:24.21,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When you guys were in the bath earlier, I called your in-laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:28.07,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Why?! Dai-chan, don't do anything weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:31.47,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not weird. They would worry, wouldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:33.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I just told them that you two are okay
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:36.44,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,and that you'd be staying here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:38.22,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't tell them my address or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:41.78,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I left a letter for them, so just let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:45.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's not the point. It may be fine for you but not for Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:50.30,Usaghi Main Top,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's with me, and she's doing fine, so it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:56.90,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's true, but if the people waiting don't know where she is or if she's okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:09:00.13,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think they'll see things the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:02.35,Usaghi Main Top,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:04.46,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down a little, Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:06.73,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to trouble them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:05.38,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:12.30,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:18.88,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That's my nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:24.70,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa and Mama are always fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.03,0:09:26.41,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Even though they're married?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.41,0:09:28.15,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, even so. {"Even so" doesn't sound like something a kid would say, but I can't think of an alternative. -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.15,0:09:30.83,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I always pretend to sleep when that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:34.43,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:36.82,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:38.59,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That's my cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:45.38,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Every single day...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:50.64,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Ever since I got married, I've been keeping my feelings bottled up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:53.81,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with causing them a little trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:00.95,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:02.55,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I said something strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:03.58,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:05.80,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.57,0:10:15.49,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:31.20,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.10,0:10:33.19,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.93,0:10:35.81,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:49.54,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:51.46,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:55.15,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning. Rin-chan, you're making breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:57.86,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Good morning to you too, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:10:59.56,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're up early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:01.48,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:04.58,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, you make Rin-chan cook for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:08.65,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,D-Don't be stupid! We always cook together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:10.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When we need to use the stove, I{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.59,0:11:11.68,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.49,0:11:17.99,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You're getting rice on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:21.67,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Finish eating soon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.95,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,We need to take the train to school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:24.89,Usaghi Main Top,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.13,0:11:27.66,Usaghi Main Top,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:27.37,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What is that, this early in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:28.88,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:31.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah! Just come in already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:33.02,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're annoying the neighbors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:35.00,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, is your school far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:36.10,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You leave this early?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.10,0:11:37.26,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:41.72,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's mom is really busy, so he comes over pretty early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:46.10,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:48.33,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, did you get married?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:50.97,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I didn't! She's my cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:53.39,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. You're not married after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:55.36,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:57.52,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, do you {\i1}want{\i0} to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:11:59.28,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that's{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.81,0:12:02.53,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, you'd prefer being single, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.01,0:12:05.74,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What does "being single" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:07.48,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It means not being married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:09.36,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know that! Being divorced, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:11.50,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what "divorced" means.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.61,0:12:16.61,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom is married but would prefer to be single,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:19.38,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,and Daikichi is single but would prefer to be married?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:21.89,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Adults are weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.89,0:12:23.43,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They sure are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.73,0:12:28.12,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can I have a rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.59,0:12:30.36,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You had breakfast before coming over, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:31.41,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:33.82,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:34.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It was supposed to be mine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:35.70,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:37.58,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{Om nom nom nom!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.58,0:12:39.07,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you have breakfast before coming over?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:40.98,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you eating again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:43.53,Usaghi Main Top,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Is that a problem? What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:41.91,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You're way too nice, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:44.03,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why, just because I gave him a rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.03,0:12:45.40,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:49.03,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You're busy too, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.57,0:12:52.18,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you really do care about that pretty mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:56.75,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I-Idiot! That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:13:01.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:04.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin seems to get along with them too,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:06.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but that's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:08.45,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.45,0:13:12.07,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,but I'm sure they've been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.07,0:13:14.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be rude if I'm too forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.48,0:13:20.77,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's hard for a woman to live alone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:26.95,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, didn't I say you're going to be late if you don't hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.73,0:13:26.00,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.39,0:13:29.27,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.27,0:13:30.87,Usaghi Main,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:33.05,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell anyone about staying over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.69,0:13:34.84,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.59,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Just keep it a secret, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:37.62,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.95,0:13:39.00,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:39.97,Usaghi Main,kid1,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.18,0:13:42.41,Usaghi Main,kid2,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan, you came with your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:43.84,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.17,0:13:47.52,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,We secretly ran away from home, so I had to come by train today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:49.81,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:16.29,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.91,0:14:19.21,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I told you hold onto it, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:21.91,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going to get you another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:26.88,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it'll get home before we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:30.53,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, maybe it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:37.96,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:40.08,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're working late today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:42.11,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, my husband is taking care of the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:43.69,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is Yuu-kun doing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:45.53,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,He sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:48.45,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,He's been so energetic lately, I don't know what to do with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.85,0:14:52.45,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's good that your husband helps you out with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:53.94,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.94,0:14:56.52,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,His business trip got canceled, so he has a day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:15:00.86,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I can't let my husband do all the parenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:06.68,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up! Reina-chan's waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:07.84,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:26.61,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home! Reina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.73,0:15:36.60,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,They went to sleep pretty early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.38,0:15:42.00,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko, you don't intend to make a big deal out of this, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:46.39,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you talking about getting a divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.95,0:15:48.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:52.13,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:56.11,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried for nothing, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.11,0:15:59.60,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I've thought about it several times, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.22,0:16:03.08,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I've been thinking about it every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:08.41,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, once you start thinking of your husband as your enemy, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:12.77,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Other than Reina, everyone else is either an enemy or a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.77,0:16:15.28,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's like the two of us make up the whole family to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:19.58,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,but I guess that's not realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:23.68,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thinking about Reina, how much I make,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:27.29,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,and how many hurdles I had to overcome before getting to that point...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:32.75,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's better for me to stay as I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:36.66,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I got married right after getting a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:42.64,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,When I was younger, all I thought about was being a good wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:45.78,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,There's no other way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:48.41,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's the only way to keep Reina safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:52.70,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I never really thought about getting married,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:55.28,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but I guess having a normal family is hard too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:16:57.93,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you do it all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:16:59.15,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's pretty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.15,0:17:01.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No. I'm not doing anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:04.92,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true. Rin-chan looks like she's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:08.15,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She cooks your meals for you and everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:12.62,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,They're working hard over at Kouki-kun's place too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:15.22,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,And I can work hard with Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:17.14,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All this talk about two people...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:19.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you talk about this with your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:22.41,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,He keeps working overtime,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:23.99,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,so I don't get to talk to him often.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:27.41,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,So I'll just have to work hard with Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:31.36,Usaghi Main,haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I've already managed to deal with it for so many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:33.44,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure I can keep doing so in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.44,0:17:37.74,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,If I just shut my feelings away, then I can get through most of the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:41.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds really unhealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:44.13,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's the opposite. If I didn't do it, I'd snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.99,0:17:48.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotten a lot stronger, Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:50.57,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.57,0:17:55.50,Usaghi Main,haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Once you start raising a kid, there are times you need to be really strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:57.66,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,especially when they're babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:02.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know much about when they're babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.78,0:18:08.12,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,When you keep at it, you naturally get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.76,0:18:11.55,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I really don't want to grow old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:15.07,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I never wanted to be strong in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.57,0:18:21.12,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to stay a girl forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.86,0:18:28.19,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Dai-chan, and thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:30.17,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go back home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:32.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:36.75,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What does it mean to be married?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.48,0:18:39.45,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What does it mean to be a parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:49.19,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? It's your turn, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.14,0:18:51.28,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.81,0:18:52.72,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.72,0:18:53.57,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Knew what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:54.92,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's Papa's car!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:59.17,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Papa is coming after work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:00.91,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,He wouldn't come so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.17,0:19:04.87,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's definitely Papa. I can't be wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.87,0:19:07.12,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You {\i1}are{\i0} wrong! Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:10.74,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.74,0:19:12.83,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried about you, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:14.54,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.41,0:19:16.60,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.60,0:19:21.32,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,So he can get off work around this time if he wants to, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:23.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:25.64,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Working for a company can be pretty rough, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:26.29,Usaghi Main Top,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hideyuki-san, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:28.61,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:30.85,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko caused you a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:33.68,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all! I didn't really{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:35.95,Usaghi Main Top,dad,0000,0000,0000,,I sincerely apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:36.15,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Damn, I'm not dressed appropriately at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:40.82,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:45.09,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Papa didn't even think to carry our luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.09,0:19:46.59,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,He's so inconsiderate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:48.75,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,He really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:54.71,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come over again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.99,0:19:58.79,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to cause you any more trouble than I already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:20:00.39,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:04.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin would like to see Reina-chan again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:11.17,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:14.55,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, Mama! Can we come back this Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.55,0:20:16.40,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,We can't do that, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:20.36,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The Haruko that was always crying as a kid
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:25.36,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and the Haruko that said she wanted to stay a little girl forever yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:28.22,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Bye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.22,0:20:31.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't pack so much stuff next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.66,0:20:32.91,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.99,0:20:36.34,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.34,0:20:38.34,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,A woman always carries a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:40.97,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.03,0:20:40.97,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.31,0:20:42.83,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.65,0:22:17.98,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:18.90,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.12,0:22:22.28,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,But this might suit you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.28,0:22:22.98,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:25.23,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I try this one on too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.53,0:22:26.31,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.31,0:22:28.04,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:30.35,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,We just need to try on some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.11,0:22:32.74,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:36.59,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I'll just go look at some stuff with Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.59,0:22:37.70,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:40.23,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,See, it looks great on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:41.97,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,You're so cute, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.63,0:22:48.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.98,0:22:50.18,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It tastes like summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.61,0:22:53.37,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
